---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(281) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Pool Equipment Repair in Spring, TX | Pumps, Filters, Heaters" description="Expert pool equipment repair in Spring, TX. Pumps, motors, filters, heaters, salt systems. Same-visit repairs when parts are on the truck.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Equipment Repair</h1>
      <p>Pumps, filters, heaters, and more — diagnosed and fixed so your system runs efficiently.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>When circulation stops or the heater fails, we respond quickly. Our technicians carry common parts and are trained on major brands used throughout the Spring and Klein areas.</p>
      <h2>What We Service</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Pool pumps and motors (single-speed, variable-speed)</li>
        <li>Filter systems (cartridge, DE, sand)</li>
        <li>Pool heaters (gas and heat pumps)</li>
        <li>Salt chlorine generators</li>
        <li>Automation and control systems</li>
        <li>Valves, multiports, and plumbing fittings</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>First-Visit Focus</h2>
      <p>We aim to diagnose accurately and complete the repair on the same visit whenever parts are available. You receive a clear explanation and written estimate before work starts.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call for Equipment Service</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
